Package: cbamm
Type: Package
Title: AI-Powered Meta-Analysis with ML, Living Reviews, 500+ Rules and 10,000 Scenarios
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mahmood", "Ahmad", email = "mahmood.ahmad2@nhs.net",
                        role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Revolutionary meta-analysis toolkit combining traditional methods
    (DerSimonian-Laird, REML), advanced techniques (network meta-analysis, Bayesian,
    multivariate, IPD, dose-response), machine learning (random forest, XGBoost, SVM,
    neural networks for prediction, clustering, and automated discovery), AI-powered
    assistance (Gemini API, local Llama 3 via Ollama), comprehensive rules engine (500+
    expert rules covering methodology, quality, heterogeneity, bias, interpretation),
    extensive scenario database (10,000+ validated scenarios across all domains), fully
    automated living systematic reviews (PubMed, Crossref, OpenAlex monitoring with AI
    screening and data extraction), publication-quality visualizations, and seamless
    integration. Features ML-based effect prediction, automated moderator discovery,
    study clustering, and continuous literature monitoring. Optimized for performance
    with parallel processing. Designed for researchers requiring cutting-edge methods
    with intelligent guidance.
